## Dump chat (admin) — done

**Direct recommendation:** one new dialog component owns the JSON snapshot; `ChatView` owns the permission check (fails closed); `ChatViewHeader` only receives `canDump` + emits `show-dump`. Export surface = **Download .json** + **Copy to clipboard**, with a truncated preview so huge chats never freeze the DOM.

### Specifications

| Area | Spec |
|---|---|
| Entry points | Mobile: `Dump` button in the collapsible actions row, right after **Export**. Desktop: icon-only `fa-bug` button after the status selector, `tooltip tooltip-bottom`, `text-warning/70 → hover:text-warning`, 2px `ring-primary/50` focus. Not hidden in channel mode (a group conversation may need a postmortem too) |
| Permission | `ChatView.isAdminUser` reads `$storex.user` defensively (`is_admin` → `isAdmin` → `roles[]` → `role`), **fails closed**; host override via the `dumpEnabled` prop |
| Modal | `max-w-4xl w-11/12`, `p-5`, 8pt rhythm (`gap-4`), warning-tinted sensitivity banner `border-warning/30 bg-warning/10` |
| Options | `checkbox checkbox-xs checkbox-primary` + clickable `label` rows (`px-2 py-2`, `hover:bg-base-content/5`) — include hidden messages / child tasks / environment / pretty print |
| Preview | `<pre>` `max-h-64`, `text-[11px] font-mono`, `bg-base-300/50`, first 40 KB only + `truncated · size` note |
| Actions | `btn-ghost` Close · `btn` Copy (swaps to `fa-check text-success` for 2.5 s) · `btn-primary` Download |
| Dump payload | `dump_version`, `kind`, `exported_at`, `exporter`, `summary`, full `chat` (all messages, hidden included), `children` (with their messages), `environment`, `diagnostics` (`role_counts`, empty messages, token/cost, `run`) |

### Code
See the three files above. Key behaviours:
- **Filename:** `chat-dump-<slug>-<YYYYMMDD-HHmmss>.json` via `Blob` + object URL (revoked after click).
- **Clipboard:** `navigator.clipboard.writeText` first, `execCommand('copy')` textarea fallback for http/insecure contexts; success/error toast via `$ui.addNotification`.
- **Never breaks:** serialization is wrapped — a non-serializable chat still yields a minimal manifest instead of a broken dialog.
- **Sidebar hook:** `handleSidebarAction` now also maps `'dump'`, so a future sidebar entry needs zero extra wiring.

### Anti-patterns avoided
- ❌ Dumping the *filtered* message list (postmortems need hidden/system messages) — the toggle defaults to `true` and the raw array is copied.
- ❌ Loading the whole JSON into the DOM for preview — capped at 40 KB.
- ❌ `navigator.clipboard`-only — silently fails on plain http.

### Accessibility checklist
- [x] Icon-only buttons carry `aria-label` + `title`; the bug button has `tooltip` text
- [x] Visible `focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/50` on every interactive element; `<pre tabindex="0">` is keyboard-scrollable
- [x] Checkboxes use real `<label>` wrapping the input (no `for`/`id` mismatch)
- [x] Meaning is never colour-only: warning banner has a lock icon + text

### Implementation notes
1. `ChatDumpDialog.vue` is new at `src/components/chat/` — in the `mobile_redesign` worktree the header lives under `client/src/components/chat/`, so mirror the component there if you keep both trees in sync.
2. Admin source: if the user store is not `$storex.user`, adjust `isAdminUser` **only** — or pass `:dump-enabled="true"` from the host. Until then the button stays hidden (safe default).
3. Server-side: if dumps should include file **contents** (not just paths), the natural next step is an admin endpoint that returns this same shape; the dialog can then swap `buildDump()` for a `$service` call without touching the UI.

